			<item>
				<title>Permandian Moko</title>
				<link>/posts/permandian-moko/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/posts/permandian-moko/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;about&#34;&gt;About&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Alam Moko is a vast blue hole close to 30 m in diameter&#xA;with direct exposure to daylight, surrounded by cliffs up to&#xA;6 m high. One passage develops to the west, but it is too narrow to allow the passage of a diver. The main passage develops to the east. It is in complete darkness, 16.5 m deep and&#xA;about 65 m long ending in a collapse of stones.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
